        "Step 1: State the primary hypothesis explicitly: a cleavage-sensitive PenTag anchor state, when coupled to a phase-separated synthetic organelle, causally localizes matrix repair to damaged regions and reduces off-target bacterial dispersion compared with an otherwise identical non-cleavable anchor system.",
